{"3723580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ascension of the Dead", "steam_appid": 3723580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/extras/c4a0c4a3dc1fc81bae082d1879f63732.poster.avif?t=1783976096\" width=800 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/extras/c4a0c4a3dc1fc81bae082d1879f63732.webm?t=1783976096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/extras/c4a0c4a3dc1fc81bae082d1879f63732.mp4?t=1783976096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ragdolls. Explosions. Soviet rocket legs.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension of the Dead is a chaotic physics-based zombie shooter where every kill turns into a chain reaction of explosions, ragdolls, and ridiculous moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not survival horror.<br>This is undead sandbox chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/extras/3a0444c71d0ff5e13372aa914f9f84d5.poster.avif?t=1783976096\" width=800 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/extras/3a0444c71d0ff5e13372aa914f9f84d5.webm?t=1783976096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/extras/3a0444c71d0ff5e13372aa914f9f84d5.mp4?t=1783976096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch them across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy absurd weapons and machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the game in increasingly stupid ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/extras/41d22713ce7eba6398cf6bbcedca4b67.poster.avif?t=1783976096\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/extras/41d22713ce7eba6398cf6bbcedca4b67.webm?t=1783976096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/extras/41d22713ce7eba6398cf6bbcedca4b67.mp4?t=1783976096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics Combat Chaos</strong> – Every bullet, explosion, and kick sends zombies flying in unpredictable ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragdoll Mayhem</strong> – Watch enemies collapse, launch, and collide into chain reactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Roulette Systems</strong> – Get random weapons from machines like the Soviet Washing Machine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Sandbox Gameplay</strong> – RPGs, grenades, cannons, and environmental kills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentum-Based Fun Loop</strong> – The more you kill, the more ridiculous it gets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABSURD ZOMBIE RAGDOLLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You shoot one and it flies like it got hit by a truck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You kick one, it explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You throw an RPG into a 30-zombie pile and watch your GPU beg for mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soviet Washing Machine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costs zombie kills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gives random weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could be a MAC-10… could be an RPG… could be regret</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perk Gumball Machine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket Jump Legs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive Ammo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed boosts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More chaos perks planned</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAPS SO FAR:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend – Vertical Platform Chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactor - Nuclear Core Physics Arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more in development (Backrooms, Theater, Football of dead)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>It’s janky. It’s busted. But it’s fun as hell.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon, mechanic, and feature has been added to make the gameplay loop feel better, faster, dumber.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE VISION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AOTD is not a horror game. It’s not serious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a sandbox slaughter sim with polish layered under madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/extras/c4a0c4a3dc1fc81bae082d1879f63732.poster.avif?t=1783976096\" width=800 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/extras/c4a0c4a3dc1fc81bae082d1879f63732.webm?t=1783976096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/extras/c4a0c4a3dc1fc81bae082d1879f63732.mp4?t=1783976096\" type=\"video/mp4\"