ss=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>It’s janky. It’s busted. But it’s fun as hell.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon, mechanic, and feature has been added to make the gameplay loop feel better, faster, dumber.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE VISION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AOTD is not a horror game. It’s not serious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a sandbox slaughter sim with polish layered under madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Kick, yeet, and explode your way through undead chaos in this fast-paced zombie shooter with brutal physics and over-the-top action.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/d9843c7329f6152a3503ac6edff775bb7be87ccd/header.jpg?t=1783976096", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/0ec6414ef3137e9004adcc8208518b1c732e859d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783976096", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723580/0ec6414ef3137e9004adcc8208518b1c732e859d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783976096", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 4000 Series<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 